      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Hi there! I need some help with a few exchanges and a cancellation from my recent orders. I’d like to swap my kid’s bicycle for one with a larger frame size—switching to a mountain bike is fine if that’s easier. Also, I want to exchange the jigsaw puzzle from the same order for one with the same difficulty but with 1000 more pieces, and I’d prefer an art theme over animals if possible.\n\nAdditionally, I’d like to exchange my camera for a model with slightly lower resolution, but I want to keep all the other features the same. For any payments or refunds, I’d prefer to use my Visa card.\n\nLastly, I need to cancel just the skateboard from one of my orders. Can you help me with all of this?",
