      "content": "Yes—I can help with exchanges and a cancellation, but first I need to authenticate your account.\n\n1) **Please tell me the email address** you used at checkout.\n\nAlso, to proceed with the specific changes, please reply with:\n2) The **order ID(s)** for:\n- the **kid’s bicycle + the jigsaw puzzle**\n- the **camera exchange**\n- the **order that contains the skateboard** (the one you want to cancel)\n\n3) For the **skateboard cancellation**, which reason applies?\n- **“no longer needed”** or **“ordered by mistake”** (those are the only allowed reasons)\n\n4) Confirm: for refunds/payment differences, you want to use your **Visa card** (just say “yes”).  \n\nOnce I have your email and the order IDs, I’ll look up the orders’ statuses and we’ll do each exchange/cancellation with your explicit “yes” before I submit anything.",
